{
    "title": "Tile Match: Triple Puzzle Game",
    "description": "\u2b50 <b>Tile Match</b>: Ultimate Brain-Teasing Tile Adventure! \u2b50\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Super fun yet challenging mahjong inspired triple tile matching game.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Are you the next Tile Master Legend? Challenge yourself with tile match 3 fun.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d <b>Game Features</b>\r\n- Easy and fun to play.\r\n- 10000+ tile puzzle levels.\r\n- Discover a myriad of themes.\r\n- Candy, fruits, animals & more.\r\n- Sharpen your brain and find joy.\r\n- Perfect time killer and IQ boost.\r\n- Both online and offline playable.\r\n- No wifi needed, play anywhere.\r\n- Regular tile game updates.\r\n- Endless matching fun awaits.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 <b>How to Play?</b>\r\n* Level starts with a board full of tiles with different patterns.\r\n* Match 3 identical block tiles, just like in Mahjong.\r\n* Match and remove all tiles on the board to claim victory.\r\n* But beware, as once the tray is filled with tiles, the game will end.\r\n\r\n\u2728 Are you ready to take on the challenge and become the ultimate Tile Match master?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Download Tile Match: Triple Puzzle Game and let the triple matching madness begin!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2b50 <b>Tile Match</b>: Ultimate Brain-Teasing Tile Adventure! \u2b50<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 Super fun yet challenging mahjong inspired triple tile matching game.<br><br>\ud83c\udf08 Are you the next Tile Master Legend? Challenge yourself with tile match 3 fun.<br><br>\ud83d\udd0d <b>Game Features</b><br>- Easy and fun to play.<br>- 10000+ tile puzzle levels.<br>- Discover a myriad of themes.<br>- Candy, fruits, animals &amp; more.<br>- Sharpen your brain and find joy.<br>- Perfect time killer and IQ boost.<br>- Both online and offline playable.<br>- No wifi needed, play anywhere.<br>- Regular tile game updates.<br>- Endless matching fun awaits.<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 <b>How to Play?</b><br>* Level starts with a board full of tiles with different patterns.<br>* Match 3 identical block tiles, just like in Mahjong.<br>* Match and remove all tiles on the board to claim victory.<br>* But beware, as once the tray is filled with tiles, the game will end.<br><br>\u2728 Are you ready to take on the challenge and become the ultimate Tile Match master?<br><br>\ud83d\ude80 Download Tile Match: Triple Puzzle Game and let the triple matching madness begin!",
